SOLID_SOLUTIONS 1
    Ca(x)Sr(1-x)SO4
        -comp Anhydrite 0.9
        -comp Celestite 0.1
SOLUTION 1
    units mol/kgw
    pH 7
    Ca 0.02
    Sr 0.002
    S(6) 0.03
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings ss_anhydrite ss_celestite
    10 PUNCH S_S("Anhydrite"), S_S("Celestite")
END
